    "en": {
      "trackName": "Dare the Monkey: Deluxe",
      "description": "Say hello to Dare, your little monkey hero! Risk life and limb as you run, jump, and roll your way across increasingly tricky worlds.\n\nDare the Monkey is an extremely addictive, super casual, one-touch platformer that evokes the spirit of classic arcade and console games. It's a love letter to the golden age of video games but expertly reinvented for mobile.\n\nEasy to pick up but difficult to master. Play it if you Dare!\n\nFEATURES\n\n• No ads\n• No in-app purchases\n• All game characters unlocked\n• Play on your iPhone, iPad, and Apple Watch\n• Play as one of nine awesome tribe members\n• Hours of arcade action\n• Two brand new exclusive characters\n• Endless lava caves game mode exclusive to Apple Watch\n• Extremely challenging",
      "releaseNotes": "Some small tweaks and fixes. Enjoy!",
